[EN]: This repository contains an unofficial Russian translation of the [The Harpy Express: Extended](https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-harpy-express-extended) modpack.

To install it, you need to:
	1) Click on "More actions" button ![More actions](screenshots/Screenshot%202026-03-19%20at%2012-59-55%20Aetherial-Mods_Elder-Scrolls-Universalis%20-%20Codeberg.org.png)
	2) Then click on "Download ZIP" ![Download ZIP](screenshots/Screenshot%202026-03-19%20at%2013-09-46%20Aetherial-Mods_Elder-Scrolls-Universalis%20-%20Codeberg.org.png)
	3) Put the ZIP archive into the `resourcepacks` folder

[RU]: Этот репозиторий неофициального перевода сбокри (The Harpy Express: Extended)[https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-harpy-express-extended] на русский язык.

Чтобы установить его вам нужно:
	1) Нажать на кнопку "Ещё действия" ![Ещё действия](screenshots/Screenshot%202026-03-19%20at%2012-59-55%20Aetherial-Mods_Elder-Scrolls-Universalis%20-%20Codeberg.org.png)
	2) После нажать на "Скачать ZIP" ![Скачать ZIP](screenshots/Screenshot%202026-03-19%20at%2013-03-45%20Aetherial-Mods_Elder-Scrolls-Universalis%20-%20Codeberg.org.png)
	3) Закинуть zip архив в папку `resourcepacks`